      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆每参加一次比赛，\n实力都会稳定提升，变得更加锋利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d234571b55f8737ce5dc97ed036281eb3cb73f8075ec3316d7e4fa3bcc5729",
